WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.045
Coming down.

00:01.745 --> 00:06.446
Thin air drags on everything in low orbit, and in the end it falls and burns.

00:06.896 --> 00:13.342
The largest spacecraft are steered down here, to the part of the Pacific farthest from any land.

00:13.792 --> 00:16.356
The Mir space station ended here.

00:16.806 --> 00:20.222
The International Space Station is due to follow.
